@startuml
left to right direction

' Minimum deployment for Exercise 9: the two sovereignty rules plus the pods
' that Tasks 3 and 4 of the sheet require. Each entity and edge below carries
' a comment that says what in the sheet mandates it, with a link to the line.
' "mandated-by:" marks what the sheet mandates (grep for it); "not mandated"
' marks parts taken from the groups' code (E7/E8).
' Sheet version: Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9 at commit 0c4250f.
'
' "Auction house" in Rule 2 is the whole Bidder application: as in the groups'
' code (E7/E8), the Worker registers with the worker pool, the auction house
' only reads it, and a won job goes through pitas-jobs and the scheduler to
' the Worker; the auction house never calls the Worker directly.
' The queue carries only notifications with links; the data is in the pods.
' Left out: permission grants, the type index (Task 4.2), and the Auctioneer's
' own worker pool and the Bidder's own auctions (each group plays both roles).
' Timing: only step 11 is placed by a rule. Step 10 could happen at any time
' (the Bidder may keep WebIDs); it comes before step 11 only because the
' WebID is needed to reach the pod.
' Layout: Client and Auctioneer left, Bidder and Worker right, queue in
' between. Arrows are written left to right (with <-- for the reverse flow)
' to keep the columns; parallel messages share one arrow, numbers give the
' order. Worker setup (1.-3.) comes before the task.

' --- Entities ---------------------------------------------------------------

' Client and ClientPod: mandated-by: Rule 1 stores task input and result in the client's
' pod; Task 1.1 states that the rules require clients to have pods.
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L175
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L184
actor Client
database ClientPod

' Auctioneer: mandated-by: the auction house that publishes the auction and reads all bids
' in the integration test.
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L238
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L239
node Auctioneer

' AuctioneerPod: mandated-by: the auction house publishes auctions "in its pod" (Task 3.2)
' and has a bid container that only it may read (Task 4.3); after a wipe the
' application rebuilds open auctions and received bids from pods (Task 3.1).
' Task 1.2 leaves the owner of bids and awards open; this diagram puts them
' here because Task 4.3 describes the bid container as the auction house's.
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L238
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L274
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L231
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L185
database AuctioneerPod

' EventQueue: not mandated. It is the event plane from Exercise 8; the sheet
' allows its state to stay in the application (Task 1) and asks whether to
' keep it next to Solid (Task 5).
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L181
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L317
queue EventQueue

' Bidder: mandated-by: the bidder of the integration test. Its split into components is
' not mandated; it follows the groups' code.
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L239
node "Bidder (PITAS application)" as BidderApp {
  node "pitas-auction-house" as BidderAH
  ' pitas-worker-pool: mandated-by: Rule 2 has workers register with an auction house.
  ' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L178
  node "pitas-worker-pool" as WorkerPool
  ' pitas-jobs + pitas-scheduler: not mandated; groups' code.
  node "pitas-jobs +\npitas-scheduler" as BidderJobs
}

' BidderPod: mandated-by: after a wipe the application rebuilds its registered workers
' from pods (Task 3.1), so the worker registry (WebIDs only) needs a pod.
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L231
database BidderPod

' Worker and WorkerPod: mandated-by: Rule 2 keeps worker details in the worker's pod;
' Task 1.1 states that the rules require workers to have pods.
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L178
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L184
control Worker
database WorkerPod

' --- Edges ------------------------------------------------------------------

' 4, 30: mandated-by: Rule 1 stores the input in the client's pod; the commissioning
' client can read the result (Task 3.2).
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L175
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L241
Client --> ClientPod : 4. write task input\n30. read task result
' 5: mandated-by: Rule 1 for passing only a link (no intermediary stores
' the input); the commission itself is not mandated.
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L175
Client --> Auctioneer : 5. commission task (link to input)
' 29: not mandated; groups' code. The link only, as for 5.
Client <-- Auctioneer : 29. notify task done (link to result)

' 6: mandated-by: the auction house publishes the auction in its pod (Task 3.2), readable
' by anyone (Task 4.3).
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L238
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L273
' 14: the auction house can read all bids (Task 3.2, Task 4.3).
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L239
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L274
' 16: the auction house awards the auction (Task 3.2); the award is stored in
' a pod (Task 1.3), whose owner Task 1.2 leaves open.
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L240
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L186
Auctioneer --> AuctioneerPod : 6. create auction (link to input)\n14. read bids\n16. write award
' 7, 17: not mandated; event plane from Exercise 8 (see EventQueue).
Auctioneer --> EventQueue : 7. push auction event (link to auction)\n17. push award event (link to award)
' 28: not mandated; event plane from Exercise 8.
Auctioneer <-- EventQueue : 28. deliver result event
' 15: not mandated; how bids are evaluated is up to the groups.
Auctioneer --> Auctioneer : 15. evaluate bids

' 9: mandated-by: the bidder discovers the auction from the auction house's WebID
' (Task 3.2).
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L238
' 13: the bidder appends a bid and cannot read others' bids (Task 3.2); the
' bid container is append-only for anyone (Task 4.3).
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L239
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L274
' 19: after the award, the task description becomes readable to the winner
' only (Task 3.2, Task 4.3).
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L240
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L275
AuctioneerPod <-- BidderAH : 9. read auction\n13. append sealed bid (Worker WebID)\n19. read award
' 8, 18: not mandated; event plane from Exercise 8.
EventQueue --> BidderAH : 8. deliver auction event\n18. deliver award event
' 27: not mandated; event plane from Exercise 8.
EventQueue <-- BidderAH : 27. push result event (link to result)
' 10: mandated-by: Rule 2 resolves details "starting from the worker's WebID"; when the
' WebIDs are read is not mandated.
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L178
BidderAH --> WorkerPool : 10. fetch registered Worker WebIDs
' 11: mandated-by: Rule 2 resolves worker details at run time, whenever needed; the bidder
' resolves them "at that moment" (Task 3.2). The read access comes from the
' registration (Task 4.3).
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L178
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L239
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L277
BidderAH --> WorkerPod : 11. fetch worker details
' 12: mandated-by: the bidder decides to bid based on its workers' details (Task 3.2).
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L239
BidderAH --> BidderAH : 12. evaluate auction
' 20, 26: mandated-by: Rule 1 for passing links only (no copies); the
' hand-over and polling themselves are not mandated (groups' code).
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L175
BidderAH --> BidderJobs : 20. hand over won job (links only)\n26. poll job status

' 1: mandated-by: Rule 2 has the worker register with an auction house; the auction house
' stores no details about it.
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L178
WorkerPool <-- Worker : 1. register (WebID only)
' 3: mandated-by: the application rebuilds its registered workers from pods after a wipe
' (Task 3.1).
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L231
WorkerPool --> BidderPod : 3. store Worker WebID
' 2: mandated-by: Rule 2 keeps the worker details in the worker's pod.
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L178
Worker --> WorkerPod : 2. write worker details
' 21, 25: mandated-by: Rule 1 for passing links only (no copies); dispatch
' and report themselves are not mandated (groups' code).
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L175
BidderJobs --> Worker : 21. dispatch (links only)
BidderJobs <-- Worker : 25. report execution done
' 22, 24: mandated-by: the worker reads the input from and writes the result into the
' client's pod (Rule 1, Task 3.2); it may write there but read nothing else
' (Task 4.3).
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L175
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L241
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L276
ClientPod <-- Worker : 22. fetch task input\n24. append task result
' 23: mandated-by: neither the winner nor any intermediary keeps a copy (Rule 1, Task 3.2).
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L175
' https://github.com/Interactions-HSG/ASSE-Exercise-9/blob/0c4250f9e526924a9fb5ac7d5c447e125c9cf964/main.tex#L241
Worker --> Worker : 23. execute (no copy kept)

@enduml
